@required_substrings: product.price, variantsJson
@required_ids: add-to-cart, variant-picker, variant-price, variant-stock, variants-data, buy-now-trigger
@notes: Sua gia, bien the, ton kho, them gio, mua ngay o day. JS phia client doc cac ID nay. #add-to-cart can data-id khi khong co bien the; khi co bien the JS tu gan data-variant-id. #variants-data phai chua {{ variantsJson }} khi product.hasVariants. #buy-now-trigger bam vao la chuyen thang sang /checkout?buyNowProductId=...&buyNowVariantId=... (xem product-detail.js initBuyNow, checkout.js doc 2 param nay de CHI hien thi/dat hang dung 1 san pham) - KHONG lam modal/form nhap thong tin rieng o day nua (cach cu tung dung buy-now-btn/buy-now-form/buy-now-cancel/buy-now-error phuc tap va trung lap voi form checkout.liquid da co san, theme leadbase da bo cach nay).
{% endcomment %}

